        "        Let \\(A=\\begin{bmatrix}2&-1 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{bmatrix}\\). Find the eigenvalues and eigenvectors of \\(A\\).\n",
        "        </p>\n",
        "        <br><br><br>\n",
